    {
     "es": "Gea, sola, dio a luz a Urano, el cielo estrellado, para que la cubriera por completo.",
     "en": "Alone, Gaia gave birth to Uranus, the starry sky, so that he would cover her completely."
    },
    {
     "es": "Juntos tuvieron hijos poderosos: doce Titanes, tres Cíclopes de un solo ojo, y tres gigantes de cien brazos, los Hecatónquiros.",
     "en": "Together they had mighty children: twelve Titans, three one-eyed Cyclopes, and three giants with a hundred arms, the Hecatoncheires."
    },
    {
     "es": "Pero Urano temía a sus propios hijos.",
     "en": "But Uranus feared his own children."
    },
    {
     "es": "Apenas nacían, los empujaba de vuelta a las profundidades de la Tierra, y no los dejaba salir.",
     "en": "As soon as they were born, he pushed them back into the depths of the Earth, and would not let them out."
    }
