     "en": "The defeated Titans were locked away in Tartarus."
    },
    {
     "es": "Atlas, uno de sus líderes, recibió un castigo especial: sostener el cielo sobre sus hombros por toda la eternidad.",
     "en": "Atlas, one of their leaders, received a special punishment: to hold up the sky on his shoulders for all eternity."
    },
    {
     "es": "Los tres hermanos se repartieron el mundo por sorteo.",
     "en": "The three brothers divided the world among themselves by drawing lots."
    },
    {
     "es": "Zeus recibió el cielo, Poseidón el mar y Hades el reino de los muertos.",
     "en": "Zeus received the sky, Poseidon the sea and Hades the kingdom of the dead."
    },
    {
     "es": "Y en la cima del monte Olimpo, los nuevos dioses construyeron su hogar.",
     "en": "And on the summit of Mount Olympus, the new gods built their home."
    }
